// woodcore:object heading title
== Neighbouring buildings
// woodcore:/object title

// woodcore:object text p1
Before work starts, a condition survey (crack record, level survey) is carried out on all neighbouring buildings and roads. Possible movements of the excavation, the new building and the surroundings are measured regularly during construction by a specialist firm; a final measurement [six months] after completion is recommended.
// woodcore:/object p1
